out = f'''<html><head><style>{css}</style></head><body>
<div class="title">Tenancy Contract v2 - Arabic DRAFT for translator review</div>
<div class="sub">Draft by Claude. NOT in the contract yet. Please check and correct the Arabic, then return it. Keep every {{{{...}}}} marker as it is.<br>Clause numbers as printed without a guarantor. * = guarantor clause, printed only when a guarantor is on the lease.</div>
<div class="box"><b>Points for translator confirmation</b><br>1. Clause 13: the old Arabic said the opposite of the English. «لا» added at the start: «لا يُعتبر عقد الإيجار نافذًا…»<br>2. Number agreement with a changing number: 17(b) «({{{{MAX_OCCUPANTS}}}}) من الأشخاص» and 13 «({{{{EJARI_REGISTRATION_DAYS}}}}) … من أيام العمل»<br>3. Guarantor clause: «مديناً أصلياً وكفيلاً متضامناً مع المستأجر» (English: "jointly and severally with the Tenant")<br>4. Annex references: standalone «الملحق (ب)»; inside brackets without inner brackets «(الملحق ب)».</div>
<table><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>English (final)</th><th>Arabic draft (النص العربي - مسودة)</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{''.join(rows)}
</tbody></table></body></html>'''
open(sys.argv[2], 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(out)
